# Security & Compliance

- Never log PII in plaintext
- PII fields use `EncryptedString` (Fernet) at rest
- Audit trail for every case/recommendation state change
- All endpoints require auth (except health)
- Multi-tenant isolation: org A never sees org B's data (return 404, not 403)
- Rate limiting on LLM endpoints (`slowapi`)
- Never commit `.env`, credentials, API keys, or PII
- GDPR: data minimization, DPA with LLM providers
- EU AI Act: human-in-the-loop, advisor reviews all recommendations
- Deterministic services handle all financial calculations — LLM explains, doesn't compute
